repository-code: "https://github.com/ambergargrish-ca/zero-to-live"
abstract: >-
  A Claude skill for taking a website or web app from idea to production:
  planning, static-first building, tiered testing (quick checks vs full suite),
  accessibility and Lighthouse targets, a security and privacy checklist, and
  batched deploys. Cloudflare Pages, D1 and R2 as the preferred stack, with
  notes for alternatives. Built and proven on Get In Tech (getintech.ca).
